The native and WebAssembly implementation is in exes/greedy. It follows the
command-line behavior of the Greedy C++ software, created by Paul Yushkevich at
the Penn Image Computing and Science Lab and maintained by the Greedy
open-source contributors. Project history and source are available at
https://sites.google.com/view/greedyreg/about and
https://github.com/pyushkevich/greedy. The upstream project is licensed under
the Apache License 2.0.

The generated browser runtime includes wasm-bindgen and wasm-bindgen-rayon.
Their generated notices and license headers are retained.
